  "content": "\n\n这个mod为<a title=\"Just Enough Items\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\"><strong>JEI</strong></a>添加了新功能。该新功能允许玩家确定每个村民职业所需的工作台。<br>\n<br>\n为此，你可以在绿宝石或村民刷怪蛋上使用JEI的Uses键（默认键位：U），它会显示所有村民职业的列表。如果你想知道某个职业是哪个mod添加的，按住Shift键可在职业名称前显示对应的模组id。<br>\n<br>\n如果你正在寻找<a title=\"Roughly Enough Items\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\"><strong>REI</strong></a>的等效mod，请参考<a title=\"Roughly Enough Professions (REP)\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/roughly-enough-professions-rep\">Roughly Enough Professions (REP)</a><br>\n<br>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz Partner\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.akliz.net/mrbysco\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器吗？使用优惠码“mrbysco”，首月可享8折优惠</a></p>\n \n<b>如有问题，欢迎加入我的Discord。</b>\n\n## 想要支持我们？##\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a> &nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ShyNieke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a> &nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>",
